0..77 Comment "// The quantifier `forall a . C`: the dependent arrow over `Type` per binder,"
78..155 Comment "// `(a : Type) -> C`, its binders written with no type (#1055). A forall is a"
156..234 Comment "// computation type, so a signature holds it under `+U` as it holds any arrow;"
235..312 Comment "// what it declares and the dependent arrow written out are one type, so each"
313..348 Comment "// stands where the other is asked."
